<pre><code><span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document\Page</span>;
<span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document\Page\Path</span>;
<span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Color\Color\Rgb</span>;

<span class="text-var">$filled</span> = <span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Path</span>(<span class="text-type">Path</span>::<span class="text-num">FILL</span>);
<span class="text-var">$filled</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setFillColor</span>(<span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Rgb</span>(<span class="text-num">0</span>, <span class="text-num">102</span>, <span class="text-num">204</span>))-&gt;<span class="text-fn">drawRectangle</span>(<span class="text-type">x</span>: <span class="text-num">100</span>, <span class="text-type">y</span>: <span class="text-num">200</span>, <span class="text-type">w</span>: <span class="text-num">100</span>, <span class="text-type">h</span>: <span class="text-num">100</span>);

<span class="text-var">$outlined</span> = <span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Path</span>(<span class="text-type">Path</span>::<span class="text-num">STROKE</span>);
<span class="text-var">$outlined</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setStrokeColor</span>(<span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Rgb</span>(<span class="text-num">0</span>, <span class="text-num">0</span>, <span class="text-num">0</span>))-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setStroke</span>(<span class="text-num">3</span>)
         -&gt;<span class="text-fn">drawRectangle</span>(<span class="text-type">x</span>: <span class="text-num">300</span>, <span class="text-type">y</span>: <span class="text-num">200</span>, <span class="text-type">w</span>: <span class="text-num">100</span>, <span class="text-type">h</span>: <span class="text-num">100</span>);

<span class="text-var">$page</span> = <span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Page</span>(<span class="text-type">Page</span>::<span class="text-num">LETTER</span>);
<span class="text-var">$page</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">addPath</span>(<span class="text-var">$filled</span>)-&gt;<span class="text-fn">addPath</span>(<span class="text-var">$outlined</span>);
</code></pre>
</div>

<h2 id="fill-and-stroke">Fill and Stroke<a class="anchor" href="#fill-and-stroke" aria-label="Link to this section">#</a></h2>

<p>A path carries one fill color and one stroke color, and both take any <code>Pop\Color</code> implementation —
<code>Rgb</code>, <code>Cmyk</code> or <code>Grayscale</code>:</p>
<div class="code-window" x-data="copyCode">
<div class="code-window-bar"><span class="code-lang">PHP</span><button type="button" class="code-copy" @click="copy()" :aria-label="copied ? 'Copied' : 'Copy code'" aria-label="Copy code"><svg x-show="!copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="9" y="9" width="11.5" height="11.5" rx="2.4"></rect><path d="M15 5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 12.4 3H5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 3 5.6v6.8A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 5.6 15"></path></svg><svg x-show="copied" x-cloak class="code-copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 12.5 9 17l10.5-10.5"></path></svg></button></div>
<pre><code><span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document\Page\Path</span>;
<span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Color\Color\Cmyk</span>;
<span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Color\Color\Rgb</span>;

<span class="text-var">$path</span> = <span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Path</span>(<span class="text-type">Path</span>::<span class="text-num">FILL_STROKE</span>);
<span class="text-var">$path</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setFillColor</span>(<span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Rgb</span>(<span class="text-num">0</span>, <span class="text-num">102</span>, <span class="text-num">204</span>));
<span class="text-var">$path</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setStrokeColor</span>(<span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Cmyk</span>(<span class="text-num">0</span>, <span class="text-num">0</span>, <span class="text-num">0</span>, <span class="text-num">100</span>));
<span class="text-var">$path</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setStroke</span>(<span class="text-num">4</span>);
<span class="text-var">$path</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">drawRectangle</span>(<span class="text-type">x</span>: <span class="text-num">100</span>, <span class="text-type">y</span>: <span class="text-num">200</span>, <span class="text-type">w</span>: <span class="text-num">300</span>, <span class="text-type">h</span>: <span class="text-num">150</span>);
</code></pre>
</div>

<p>The style decides which color paints:</p>
<ul>
<li><code>Path::FILL</code> — the interior; ink stops exactly on the shape's edges</li>
<li><code>Path::STROKE</code> — the outline, straddling the edge so a 4-point stroke puts ink two points beyond every side</li>
<li><code>Path::FILL_STROKE</code> — both, interior first</li>
</ul>
<p>Both colors persist across shapes — set one once and reuse it, or change it partway through:</p>
<div class="code-window" x-data="copyCode">
<div class="code-window-bar"><span class="code-lang">PHP</span><button type="button" class="code-copy" @click="copy()" :aria-label="copied ? 'Copied' : 'Copy code'" aria-label="Copy code"><svg x-show="!copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="9" y="9" width="11.5" height="11.5" rx="2.4"></rect><path d="M15 5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 12.4 3H5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 3 5.6v6.8A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 5.6 15"></path></svg><svg x-show="copied" x-cloak class="code-copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 12.5 9 17l10.5-10.5"></path></svg></button></div>
<pre><code><span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document\Page\Path</span>;
<span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Color\Color\Rgb</span>;

<span class="text-var">$path</span> = <span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Path</span>(<span class="text-type">Path</span>::<span class="text-num">FILL</span>);
<span class="text-var">$path</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setFillColor</span>(<span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Rgb</span>(<span class="text-num">0</span>, <span class="text-num">102</span>, <span class="text-num">204</span>));
<span class="text-var">$path</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">drawSquare</span>(<span class="text-type">x</span>: <span class="text-num">100</span>, <span class="text-type">y</span>: <span class="text-num">600</span>, <span class="text-type">w</span>: <span class="text-num">80</span>);
<span class="text-var">$path</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">drawSquare</span>(<span class="text-type">x</span>: <span class="text-num">220</span>, <span class="text-type">y</span>: <span class="text-num">600</span>, <span class="text-type">w</span>: <span class="text-num">80</span>);

<span class="text-var">$path</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setFillColor</span>(<span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Rgb</span>(<span class="text-num">204</span>, <span class="text-num">102</span>, <span class="text-num">0</span>));
<span class="text-var">$path</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">drawSquare</span>(<span class="text-type">x</span>: <span class="text-num">340</span>, <span class="text-type">y</span>: <span class="text-num">600</span>, <span class="text-type">w</span>: <span class="text-num">80</span>);
</code></pre>
</div>

<p><code>setStroke()</code> takes a width and, optionally, a dash length and a dash gap:</p>
<div class="code-window" x-data="copyCode">
<div class="code-window-bar"><span class="code-lang">PHP</span><button type="button" class="code-copy" @click="copy()" :aria-label="copied ? 'Copied' : 'Copy code'" aria-label="Copy code"><svg x-show="!copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="9" y="9" width="11.5" height="11.5" rx="2.4"></rect><path d="M15 5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 12.4 3H5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 3 5.6v6.8A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 5.6 15"></path></svg><svg x-show="copied" x-cloak class="code-copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 12.5 9 17l10.5-10.5"></path></svg></button></div>
<pre><code><span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document\Page\Path</span>;
<span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Color\Color\Rgb</span>;

<span class="text-var">$path</span> = <span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Path</span>();
<span class="text-var">$path</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setStrokeColor</span>(<span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Rgb</span>(<span class="text-num">0</span>, <span class="text-num">0</span>, <span class="text-num">0</span>));
<span class="text-var">$path</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setStroke</span>(<span class="text-num">2</span>, <span class="text-type">dashLength</span>: <span class="text-num">8</span>, <span class="text-type">dashGap</span>: <span class="text-num">4</span>);
<span class="text-var">$path</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">drawLine</span>(<span class="text-type">x1</span>: <span class="text-num">100</span>, <span class="text-type">y1</span>: <span class="text-num">400</span>, <span class="text-type">x2</span>: <span class="text-num">400</span>, <span class="text-type">y2</span>: <span class="text-num">400</span>);
</code></pre>
</div>

<p>A dash pattern needs both <code>$dashLength</code> and <code>$dashGap</code>; passing only one, or neither, draws a solid
line with no error.</p>
<p><code>setStroke(0)</code> is not &quot;no stroke&quot; — it still emits the <code>0 w</code> operator, the thinnest line the device
renders (one pixel at 72 DPI, finer as resolution rises). For no outline at all, construct with
<code>Path::FILL</code> instead.</p>
<h2 id="shapes">Shapes<a class="anchor" href="#shapes" aria-label="Link to this section">#</a></h2>

<p>Where a method takes a <code>$w</code> and an optional <code>$h</code>, leaving <code>$h</code> off makes the shape square or circular:
<code>drawRectangle(x: 100, y: 200, w: 150)</code> draws a 150-point square and
<code>drawEllipse(x: 300, y: 400, w: 100)</code> a circle.</p>
<h3 id="lines">Lines<a class="anchor" href="#lines" aria-label="Link to this section">#</a></h3>

<p><code>drawLine($x1, $y1, $x2, $y2)</code> runs a straight line between two points:</p>
